      "id": "coherent-run-plan-action-and-status-resources",
      "type": "negative_control",
      "statement": "Run detail exact-hydrates the bound WorkItem and complete transition history. It reads bounded plan, control, approval, action, and artifact projections, rereads the parent Run to detect its drift, and separately validates child lineage; this is not a database-wide repeatable-read claim. The single-installation 43-instance status preserves catalog order; its strong ETag covers latest Run creation and update times, and dynamic instance detail rejects drift.",
      "test_refs": [
        "tests/integration/db/test_api_07_inspection_repositories.py::test_api_07_run_page_binds_work_and_validates_complete_history",
        "tests/integration/db/test_api_07_inspection_repositories.py::test_api_07_sealed_plan_and_artifact_keyset_page_fail_closed",
